export anchor RoundedBubblesStyle:
    number: 346
    screen: TeamChat
    name: Rounded bubbles
    idea: A friendly messenger on deep plum where every person speaks in their own softly coloured bubble, your own words glow coral on the right, and every shape is a pill or a circle.
    base: dark
    palette:
        plum: #1b1530, the page and the style sheet
        card: #261e42, the sidebar and chat cards
        pill: #342a57, channel pills, the composer and chips
        line: #4a3f78, chip rims
        ink: #f4efff, text in bubbles and cards
        muted: #bfb3e0, labels and presence words
        coral: #ff9e7a, your own bubble, Send and the mention badge, with text #3a1206
        sun: #ffd166, the current channel, the thread chip and focus, with text #3a2a00
        mint: #7ef0c0, the new count badge and the online dot
        teal: #154a4a, Priya's bubbles
        berry: #4d2149, Aiko's bubbles
        blue: #1e3462, Jonas's bubbles
    type:
        A rounded stack, ui-rounded, SF Pro Rounded, Nunito, Varela Round,
        then system-ui, Segoe UI, Roboto. Base 15px at 1.45. Channel title
        19px at 800, bubble names 13px at 800, sheet title 30px at 900.
    layout:
        Two floating cards with 28px corners on the plum page, a 260px
        sidebar and the chat, 20px apart. The sidebar has a coral circle b
        mark and Brightwork Chat, then channels as full pills, the current
        one sun yellow, unread bold with a mint 4 new pill, the mention
        with a coral @ 1 pill. Direct messages are pills with a small
        round avatar, the name and a dot, crescent or ring with the word.
        The chat card header has a sun yellow rounded square with a hash,
        design-crit and Today. Messages zigzag as bubbles capped at 78
        percent width with round initials avatars at the bottom. Each
        other person has their own tinted bubble with a 6px tail corner.
        Mara's bubble is coral on the right, labelled Mara Okafor (you).
        Aiko's bubble carries reaction pills for thumbs up 3 and eyes 1
        and a sun 3 replies pill. Priya's image sits inside her bubble as a
        rounded preview over Image and the filename. A grey pill of three
        dots with Priya is typing sits above a pill composer with a round
        plus, the field, a round emoji button and a round coral send arrow.
        Below 820px the sidebar stacks on top with wrapped pills.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 14px between bubbles, 10px by 16px bubble padding, 20px card padding.
    density: Relaxed. Bubbles cap at 78 percent so the feed zigzags.
    corners: 28px cards, 22px bubbles with one 6px tail corner, pills and circles everywhere else.
    borders: Almost none. 2px rims on reaction chips and a 2px pill coloured line under the chat header.
    shadows: None. Colour blocks carry the depth.
    icons: Chunky rounded line icons at 2.2 stroke inside 40px circles. Presence is a dot, crescent or ring beside the word.
    focus: A 3px sun yellow outline offset 3px, wrapping the whole composer pill.
    tone: Warm and casual, such as 4 new, Mara Okafor (you) and 3 replies with an arrow.
